   "text": "~/BoardAI/            vault · source of truth\n  sessions/2026-10-14-request-path/\n    events.jsonl      append-only log\n    board.excalidraw  final board\n    digest.md         summary · proposals\n  notes/<slug>.md\n  projects/<name>.md  - [ ] task ^t27\n  memory/about-you.md\n  memory/facts.md",
